# Focus Shield & Islamic Wellbeing - Cline Rules

1. Dual-Edition Architecture:
   - Always check `AppConfig.isIslamicEdition` before rendering Islamic features.
   - Keep Focus features in `lib/features/focus_engine/` and Islamic features in `lib/features/islamic_hub/`.
   - Shared widgets belong in `lib/core/widgets/`.

2. Code Quality:
   - Use strict null-safety and const constructors.
   - Use SharedPreferences for local offline storage (streaks, settings, focus logs).
   - Keep files modular and concise.